  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome 4 NGO Anti-corruption Action Centre</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will focus on civil society oversight of non-lethal procurements by the Ministry of Defence as well as key legislation and stakeholders involved in this process, with a particular focus on the State Rare Operator, (known under its Ukrainian abbreviation DOT), with the aim of promoting integrity and good governance in the non-lethal procurement in the Ukrainian defence sector</narrative>
  </description>
